#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:5
msgid "Fields Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija polj"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:8
msgid "List fields"
msgstr "Seznam polj"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:12
msgid ""
"You can choose which fields will appears on Galette members list and the "
"order they will appear with a drag & drop interface. Related access rights "
"can be set from core fields configuration (see below)."
msgstr ""
"S funkcijo »povleci in spusti« lahko izberete, katera polja se bodo "
"prikazala na seznamu članov Galette in v kakšnem vrstnem redu se bodo "
"prikazala. Sorodne pravice dostopa lahko nastavite v konfiguraciji osnovnih "
"polj (glejte spodaj)."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:16
msgid "Two fields are mandatory and cannot be moved: member number and name."
msgstr ""
"Dve polji sta obvezni in ju ni mogoče premakniti: številka člana in ime."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:18
msgid ""
"It is not possible to set access rights on id column, and parent will be "
"accessible for staff members only."
msgstr ""
"V stolpcu z Id-jem ni mogoče nastaviti pravic dostopa, zato bo do "
"nadrejenega dostopa lahko dostopali samo člani osebja."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:20
msgid "List fields management"
msgstr "Upravljanje polj seznama"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:28
msgid "Mandatory fields and access rights"
msgstr "Obvezna polja in pravice dostopa"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:30
msgid ""
"When you create or edit a member, some fields are mandatory. Default "
"configuration may not suit your needs, but you can configure some elements "
"easily ;)"
msgstr ""
"Ko ustvarjate ali urejate člana, so nekatera polja obvezna. Privzeta "
"konfiguracija morda ne ustreza vašim potrebam, vendar lahko nekatere "
"elemente preprosto konfigurirate ;)"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:32
msgid ""
"From the `Configuration`, `Core fields` menu, you will get access to all "
"fields available for members, and choose for each one if it is mandatory or "
"not, as well as associated access rights:"
msgstr ""
"V meniju »Konfiguracija«, »Osnovna polja« boste imeli dostop do vseh polj, "
"ki so na voljo članom, in za vsako polje lahko izberete, ali je obvezno ali "
"ne, ter z njim povezane pravice dostopa:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:34
msgid "`inaccessible` will make the field inaccessible for everyone,"
msgstr "»nedostopno« bo polje naredilo nedostopno za vsakogar,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:35
msgid ""
"`administrator` will make the field readable and writeable for "
"administrators only,"
msgstr ""
"`administrator` bo polje omogočil branje in pisanje samo za administratorje,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:36
msgid ""
"`staff members` will make the field readable and writable for staff members "
"and administrators,"
msgstr ""
"»Člani osebja« bodo polje naredili berljivo in pisno za člane osebja in "
"administratorje,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:37
msgid ""
"`groups managers` will make the field readable and writable for groups "
"managers on the members of groups they own, and for staff members and "
"administrators,"
msgstr ""
"`upravljavci skupin` bodo polje omogočili branje in pisanje za upravitelje "
"skupin članov skupin, ki so v njihovi lasti, ter za člane osebja in "
"administratorje,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:38
msgid ""
"`read/write` will make the field readable and writeable for member, groups "
"managers, staff members and administrators,"
msgstr ""
"`read/write` bo polje omogočilo branje in pisanje za člane, vodje skupin, "
"člane osebja in administratorje,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:39
msgid ""
"`read only` will make the field read only for the members, but writable for "
"groups managers, staff members and administrators."
msgstr ""
"`samo za branje` bo polje samo za branje za člane, vendar bo dostopno za "
"pisanje za vodje skupin, člane osebja in administratorje."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:41
msgid "Core fields management"
msgstr "Upravljanje ključnih polj"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:49
msgid "Dynamic fields"
msgstr "Dinamična polja"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:51
msgid ""
"Galette comes per default with many fields for members, contributions and "
"transactions. Some of them will be useless, but you may need fields that "
"does not exists..."
msgstr ""
"Galette ima privzeto veliko polj za člane, prispevke in transakcije. "
"Nekatera od njih bodo neuporabna, vendar boste morda potrebovali polja, ki "
"jih ni ..."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:53
msgid ""
"In this case, that is quite simple : just add a new dynamic field with a "
"label, define if it is mandatory or not, and that's all : Galette will "
"handle them automatically, just show the result ;)"
msgstr ""
"V tem primeru je to precej preprosto: samo dodajte novo dinamično polje z "
"oznako, določite, ali je obvezno ali ne, in to je vse: Galette jih bo "
"samodejno obdelala, samo prikazala bo rezultat ;)"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:55
msgid "There are several types of dynamic fields:"
msgstr "Obstaja več vrst dinamičnih polj:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:57
msgid "`separator`: just a label, like a part title,"
msgstr "`separator`: samo oznaka, kot naslov dela,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:58
msgid "`free text`: multiline text area,"
msgstr "`free text`: večvrstično besedilno območje,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:59
msgid "`single line`: one line text,"
msgstr "`single line`: enovrstično besedilo,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:60
msgid "`choice`: a dropdown list,"
msgstr "`choice`: spustni seznam,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:61
msgid "`date`: a date field with a selector,"
msgstr "`date`: polje za datum z izbirnikom,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:62
msgid "`boolean`: a checkbox,"
msgstr "`boolean`: potrditveno polje"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:63
msgid "`file`: add files."
msgstr "`file`: dodajanje datotek."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:65
msgid ""
"Dynamic fields can be added to the members, contributions and transactions "
"forms, and to the :ref:`preferences <pref_dynamic_fields>`. Go to "
"**Configuration**, then **Dynamic fields**, pick the form, and click on "
"**Add**."
msgstr ""
"Dinamična polja lahko dodate obrazcem za člane, prispevke in transakcije ter "
"v :ref:`nastavitve <pref_dynamic_fields>`. Pojdite na **Konfiguracija**, "
"nato na **Dinamična polja**, izberite obrazec in kliknite **Dodaj**."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:71
msgid ""
"Dynamic date fields used to be stored using logged-in user locale format; "
"which causes issues trying to make searches. Now, every date is stored using "
"the `Y-m-d` format."
msgstr ""
"Dinamična datumska polja so bila prej shranjena v obliki jezika za "
"prijavljene uporabnike, kar je povzročalo težave pri iskanju. Zdaj je vsak "
"datum shranjen v obliki `d.m.Y`."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:73
msgid ""
"If you were using dynamic date fields, you will have to :ref:`update your "
"data using the related admin tool <admintools>` (⚠️ make sure to backup your "
"database before! ⚠️)."
msgstr ""
"Če ste uporabljali dinamična datumska polja, boste morali :ref:`posodobiti "
"svoje podatke z uporabo ustreznega skrbniškega orodja <admintools>` (⚠️ pred "
"tem poskrbite za varnostno kopiranje baze podatkov! ⚠️)."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:75
msgid "While creating a new field (or editing an existing one); you also can:"
msgstr "Med ustvarjanjem novega polja (ali urejanjem obstoječega) lahko tudi:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:77
msgid "mark it as required,"
msgstr "označi kot obvezno,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:78
msgid "define access rights, the same as for core fields,"
msgstr "definirajte pravice dostopa, enako kot za osnovna polja,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:79
msgid "add extra information to help users."
msgstr "dodajte dodatne informacije za pomoč uporabnikom."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:81
msgid "A dynamic field"
msgstr "Dinamično polje"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:86
msgid ""
"Some field types like separators, dates and booleans, does not need any "
"extra information; for others:"
msgstr ""
"Nekatere vrste polj, kot so ločila, datumi in logične vrednosti, ne "
"potrebujejo dodatnih informacij; za druge:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:88
msgid "`free text`:"
msgstr "`free text`:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:90
msgid "`width`: define number of columns,"
msgstr "`width`: določi število stolpcev,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:91
msgid "`height`: define number of rows."
msgstr "`height`: določi število vrstic."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:93
msgid "`single line`:"
msgstr "`ena vrstica`:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:95
msgid "`width`: field width,"
msgstr "`width`: širina polja,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:96
msgid "`size`: number of characters,"
msgstr "`size`: število znakov,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:97
msgid "`repeat`: number of possible occurrences."
msgstr "`repeat`: število možnih ponovitev."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:99
msgid "`choice`:"
msgstr "`izbira`:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:101
msgid "`values`: possible values for the dropdown."
msgstr "`values`: možne vrednosti za spustni meni."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:103
msgid "`file`:"
msgstr "`file`:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:105
msgid ""
"`size`: maximum file size, in KiB (this size is limited to the one for the "
"PHP configuration)."
msgstr ""
"`size`: največja velikost datoteke v Kio (ta velikost je omejena na velikost "
"za konfiguracijo PHP)."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:107
msgid "Fields that hold a value also accept:"
msgstr "Polja, ki vsebujejo vrednost, sprejemajo tudi:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:109
msgid "**Min Size**: for single line fields, the minimum number of characters,"
msgstr "**Najmanjša velikost**: za enovrstična polja najmanjše število znakov,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:110
msgid ""
"**Information**: a help text displayed along with the field; check **Display "
"information above input** to display it above the field rather than under it,"
msgstr ""
"**Informacije**: besedilo pomoči, prikazano skupaj s poljem; označite "
"**Prikaži informacije nad vnosom**, da jih prikažete nad poljem in ne pod "
"njim,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:111
msgid ""
"**Width in forms**: whether the field takes the full width of the form, or "
"half of it."
msgstr ""
"**Širina v obrazcih**: ali polje zavzame celotno širino obrazca ali njeno "
"polovico."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:115
msgid ""
"The **Permissions** of a new field are set to **Inaccessible**: choose who "
"can see or fill in the field, members, group managers, staff members or "
"administrators."
msgstr ""
"**Dovoljenja** novega polja so nastavljena na **Nedostopno**: izberite, kdo "
"lahko vidi ali izpolni polje, člane, upravitelje skupin, člane osebja ali "
"skrbnike."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:120
msgid "Repeatable fields"
msgstr "Ponovljiva polja"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:124
msgid ""
"Choice, date and file fields can be repeated too, not only single line "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Ponavljajo se lahko tudi polja izbire, datuma in datoteke, ne le enovrstična "
"polja."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:126
msgid ""
"Single line, choice, date and file fields can hold several values; several "
"phone numbers, for example. Set the **Repeat** option to the maximum number "
"of values, or to ``0`` for no limit. Leave it empty, or set it to ``1``, for "
"a field that holds a single value."
msgstr ""
"Polja za eno vrstico, izbiro, datum in datoteko lahko vsebujejo več "
"vrednosti; več telefonskih številk, npr. Nastavite možnost **Ponovi** na "
"največje število vrednosti ali na ``0``, če ni omejitve. Pustite prazno ali "
"ga nastavite na ``1`` za polje, ki vsebuje eno samo vrednost."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:128
msgid "A repeatable dynamic field"
msgstr "Ponovljivo dinamično polje"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:133
msgid ""
"On the form, the field is displayed once, with an **Add** button and the "
"number of values that can still be added. Each click adds one more value."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu se polje enkrat prikaže z gumbom **Dodaj** in številom vrednosti, "
"ki jih je še mogoče dodati. Vsak klik doda še eno vrednost."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:135
msgid "A repeatable dynamic field on the member form"
msgstr "Ponovljivo dinamično polje na obrazcu člana"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:141
msgid "Labels translation"
msgstr "Prevod oznak"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:143
msgid ""
"Galette handles several languages, but some texts are typed by yourself, in "
"one language only: names of dynamic fields, statuses, contribution types, "
"payment types, social networks and documents types, and some preferences "
"such as the slogan or the member card texts. Galette proposes an interface "
"to translate those labels in each available language."
msgstr ""
"Galette podpira več jezikov, vendar nekatera besedila vnesete sami, in sicer "
"le v enem jeziku: imena dinamičnih polj, statuse, vrste prispevkov, načine "
"plačila, družbena omrežja in vrste dokumentov ter nekatere nastavitve, kot "
"sta slogan ali besedilo na članski izkaznici. Galette ponuja vmesnik za "
"prevajanje teh oznak v vsakega od razpoložljivih jezikov."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:145
msgid ""
"A new label is considered as written in the current language of Galette: its "
"translation for this language is filled in, the others are empty. When a "
"translation is empty, the original text is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Šteje se, da je nova oznaka napisana v trenutnem jeziku Galette: njen prevod "
"za ta jezik je izpolnjen, ostali so prazni. Ko je prevod prazen, se prikaže "
"izvirno besedilo."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:147
msgid ""
"Go to **Configuration**, then **Labels translation**, select the label, and "
"type its translation in each language. The **Translate** icon of the "
"statuses, contribution types, payment types and dynamic fields lists, and "
"the **Translate** links of the preferences, open the same form for one label "
"only."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite v **Konfiguracijo** in nato v **Prevajanje oznak**, izberite oznako "
"ter vnesite njen prevod v posameznem jeziku. Ikona **Prevedi** na seznamih "
"statusov, vrst prispevkov, vrst plačil in dinamičnih polj ter povezave "
"**Prevedi** v nastavitvah odprejo isti obrazec, vendar le za eno oznako."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:149
msgid "Translating a label typed in French"
msgstr "Prevajanje nalepke, vtipkane v francoščino"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:157
msgid "Labels provided by Galette"
msgstr "Oznake zagotavlja Galette"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:161
msgid ""
"Translations of the labels provided by Galette are displayed, instead of an "
"empty form whose values were not used."
msgstr ""
"Namesto praznega obrazca, katerega vrednosti niso bile uporabljene, so "
"prikazani prevodi oznak, ki jih ponuja Galette."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:163
msgid ""
"Default statuses, contribution types and payment types are provided by "
"Galette, and are translated along with the software. Their translation form "
"displays those translations, read-only: to improve one of them, contribute "
"to the `Galette translation on Weblate <https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/"
"galette/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Privzete statuse, vrste prispevkov in vrste plačil zagotavlja Galette in so "
"prevedeni skupaj s programsko opremo. Njihov obrazec za prevajanje prikazuje "
"te prevode samo za branje: če želite izboljšati enega od njih, prispevajte k "
"`Galette prevodu na Weblate <https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/galette/>`_."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:165
msgid "Read-only translations of a label provided by Galette"
msgstr "Prevodi etikete samo za branje, ki jih zagotavlja Galette"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:170
msgid ""
"Their edit form reminds that changing such a label replaces its automatic "
"translations: the new label is then a text of your own, to be translated "
"like any other."
msgstr ""
"Njihov obrazec za urejanje opozarja, da spreminjanje take oznake nadomesti "
"njene samodejne prevode: nova oznaka je nato vaše lastno besedilo, ki ga je "
"treba prevesti kot vsako drugo."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:172
msgid "Editing a contribution type"
msgstr "Urejanje vrste prispevka"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:180
msgid "Changing a label"
msgstr "Spreminjanje oznake"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:184
msgid ""
"Translations can be kept when a label is changed. They used to be reset."
msgstr ""
"Prevode je mogoče obdržati, ko se oznaka spremeni. Včasih so bili "
"ponastavljeni."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:186
msgid ""
"When you change one of your own labels, its edit form proposes to **keep its "
"translations in other languages**, checked by default:"
msgstr ""
"Ko spremenite eno od svojih oznak, njen obrazec za urejanje predlaga "
"**ohranjanje njenih prevodov v drugih jezikih**, privzeto potrjeno:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:188
msgid ""
"**Checked**: translations in other languages are copied to the new label. "
"Keep it checked to fix a typo, or for a change that does not alter the "
"meaning,"
msgstr ""
"**Preverjeno**: prevodi v drugih jezikih so kopirani v novo oznako. Naj bo "
"potrjeno, da popravite tipkarsko napako ali za spremembo, ki ne spremeni "
"pomena,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:189
msgid ""
"**Unchecked**: translations are reset, as for a new label. Uncheck it when "
"the meaning changes, since existing translations would no longer be right."
msgstr ""
"**Nepreverjeno**: prevodi so ponastavljeni, kot za novo oznako. Počistite "
"polje, ko se pomen spremeni, saj obstoječi prevodi ne bi bili več pravilni."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:191
msgid ""
"In both cases, the translation in the current language becomes the new label."
msgstr "V obeh primerih prevod v trenutnem jeziku postane nova oznaka."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:193
msgid "Keeping translations when changing a dynamic field name"
msgstr "Ohranjanje prevodov pri spreminjanju imena dinamičnega polja"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:198
msgid ""
"The same label can be used by several objects, a status and a contribution "
"type for example: they share the same translations, which are kept as long "
"as one of them still uses the label."
msgstr ""
"Isto oznako lahko uporablja več predmetov, na primer status in tip "
"prispevka: delijo iste prevode, ki se hranijo, dokler eden od njih še "
"uporablja oznako."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:203
msgid "Emails contents"
msgstr "Vsebina e-poštnih sporočil"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:205
msgid ""
"Depending on your configuration (see :ref:`preferences <pref_email>`), "
"administrative emails can be sent to users and/or administrators, when you "
"add a new member or a new contribution, or from the lost password feature "
"for example."
msgstr ""
"Odvisno od vaše konfiguracije (glejte :ref:`preferences <pref_email>`) se "
"lahko upravna e-poštna sporočila pošljejo uporabnikom in/ali skrbnikom, ko "
"dodate novega člana ali nov prispevek ali na primer iz funkcije izgubljenega "
"gesla."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:207
msgid "Defaults are provided, but you can change them."
msgstr "Privzete nastavitve so na voljo, vendar jih lahko spremenite."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:209
msgid ""
"It is important to note that those texts contain variables - of the "
"``{VARIABLE}`` form - that will be replaced automatically on sending. Be "
"careful not to forget any of those, that could cause sending issues."
msgstr ""
"Pomembno je vedeti, da ta besedila vsebujejo spremenljivke – oblike "
"``{VARIABLE}`` – ki bodo ob pošiljanju samodejno zamenjane. Pazite, da ne "
"pozabite katere od teh, saj bi to lahko povzročilo težave pri pošiljanju."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:211
msgid "Edit mail send to a new member in french"
msgstr "Urejanje e-pošte, poslane novemu članu v francoščini"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:216
msgid "An email will be send to member when:"
msgstr "Članu bo poslano e-poštno sporočilo, ko:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:218
msgid ""
"they register on their own. This mail contains authentication information,"
msgstr ""
"se registrirajo sami. Ta pošta vsebuje podatke za preverjanje pristnosti,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:219
msgid ""
"their card is added or edited by someone else (if the corresponding box is "
"checked),"
msgstr ""
"njihovo kartico doda ali uredi nekdo drug (če je ustrezno polje označeno),"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:220
msgid "they use the lost password feature,"
msgstr "uporabljajo funkcijo izgubljenega gesla,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:221
msgid ""
"a new contribution is attached to their account (if the corresponding box is "
"checked)."
msgstr ""
"na njegov račun se pripiše nov prispevek (če je ustrezno polje označeno)."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:223
msgid "An email will be send to administrators when:"
msgstr "E-poštno sporočilo bo poslano administratorjem, ko:"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:225
msgid "a new member is added or registers on their own,"
msgstr "je dodan nov član ali se registrira sam,"

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:226
msgid "a new contribution is attached to a member account."
msgstr "Nov prispevek je dodan računu člana."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:228
msgid ""
"Of course, emails will be sent only if Galette configuration allows it (and "
"the setup is correct). Sending messages to administrators is configured "
"globally from the preferences, while sending emails to members is "
"conditioned on a checkbox from the user interface, excepting for self "
"registration messages that will always be send."
msgstr ""
"Seveda bodo e-poštna sporočila poslana le, če to omogoča konfiguracija "
"sistema Galette (in je nastavitev pravilna). Pošiljanje sporočil skrbnikom "
"se nastavi globalno v razdelku z nastavitvami, medtem ko je pošiljanje e-"
"pošte članom odvisno od izbire v uporabniškem vmesniku – z izjemo sporočil o "
"samostojni registraciji, ki se pošljejo vedno."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:230
msgid ""
"Several variables - automatically replaced on sending - are available for "
"both subject and contents. Some of them may be used in all messages, but "
"others will be only on some conditions. Refer to the inline help on Galette "
"interface to know more."
msgstr ""
"Za zadevo in vsebino je na voljo več spremenljivk, ki se ob pošiljanju "
"samodejno zamenjajo. Nekatere od njih se lahko uporabijo v vseh sporočilih, "
"druge pa le pod določenimi pogoji. Za več informacij glejte vgrajeno pomoč v "
"vmesniku Galette."

